OL,3,GNEWSAFrustration over scaled back High
OL,4,AStreet scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FShop owners say they are "very
OL,7,Ffrustrated" that plans for an ongoing
OL,8,FHigh Street regeneration have been
OL,9,Fscaled back due to to increasing costs.
OL,11,FOxfordshire County Council's #4.4m
OL,12,Fscheme for Witney High Street is
OL,13,Fnearing completion, following months of
OL,14,Fdisruption for businesses and shoppers.
OL,16,FBut rising costs and drainage issues
OL,17,Fmean the plans have been amended to
OL,18,Finclude fewer trees, planted areas and
OL,19,Fbenches - all a key part of the initial
OL,20,Fdesign.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
