OL,3,GNEWSAFrustration over scaled back High
OL,4,AStreet scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FRob Steere, secretary of the Witney
OL,7,FChamber of Commerce, said he now felt
OL,8,Fthe current proposals would now be a
OL,9,F"very hard thing to say yes to".
